  # Absolute total-intake achieved common-sample sensitivity ----
  # Restrict the validated achieved total-intake data to observations with a
  # finite assignment-derived total intake. This gives the achieved and
  # assignment families the same pointwise sample without changing the shared
  # 78.785 g/day reference or the 50 g/day internal exposure unit.
